      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Niacin treatment (alone) was compared with etofibrate and niacin combination to treat patients with high-density lipoprotein <35 mg/dl and without hypertriglyceridemia. The niacin and etofibrate combination proved to be safe and increased high-density lipoprotein cholesterol levels to 48%, which was 3 times higher than that obtained with niacin alone."},
